      node: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8a07368a5cfc1cf42a94192573e4e01e, type: 2}
  - condition: (history:) does not contain "Interrogation Room"
    text: "<b>Detective Miller:</b>\r\n\"Alright, let's get this roster organized.
      The assistant curator, Yuki, is the one who actually discovered the body, though
      the security chief, Victor, is the one who made the 911 call. There was another
      employee on-site\u2014Leo, the archive assistant\u2014but the kid was running
      on fumes after pulling an all-night digitization shift. I let him head home
      to get some sleep. We'll bring him back in later.\r\n\r\n\"As for the rest...
      the victim's brother, Thomas, just arrived outside the tape, and we called
      the ex-wife, Elena, earlier and had her brought down. They're all waiting.
      Let's see whose story cracks first.\"\r\n\r\n"
    links: []
  - condition: 
    text: '[<b>Detective Miller:</b>

      "You won''t believe this. A call from
      forensics just came over and the key you sent for examination... it had Elena''s
      fingerprints on it. They said it was fresh and was used recently to unlock
      a door.

      

      "We can finally catch her for something."

      

      <b>[CLUE
      COLLECTED: Master Key Fingerprints]</b>

      

      ]Who do you want to
      interrogate?

      

      

      

      

      

      

'
