  - condition: (history:) contains "Interview Yuki" and (history:) contains "Interview
      Victor" and (history:) contains "Interview Thomas" and (history:) contains
      "Interview Elena" and (history:) contains "Miller - Key Handoff" and ((history:)
      does not contain "Contract Clue Unlock")
    text: '<b>Detective Miller:</b>

      "That''s everyone. And every single one
      of them is a dead end on paper. We aren''t getting anything else out of them
      right now. You have the master key. Go back and crack open that Private Office
      before the city council shuts us down."

      

'
